# Helm context hygiene

## Scope

This workspace is Helm only. Ignore lab `Development/CLAUDE.md`, Z2H, and Zendesk/TSE rules even if a parent or global copy is still visible.

## Chat

- Fresh chat when prior thread is long or off-topic.
- `@` 2-3 relevant files. No large pastes (RTF research, full audits, giant logs).
- Engine research truth: `Docs/Research/RECONCILE.md` (not `Docs/Research/*.rtf`).

## Subagents

Broad "where is X / how does Y work" exploration: Task tool with `subagent_type=explore`. Keep parent chat for decisions and edits.

## Build noise

Use `scripts/xcodebuild.sh` so compile chatter stays out of context.
